OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPC killed by car going wrong-way
OL,4,Awas 'hero'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the two police officers who were
OL,7,Fkilled when a car travelling the wrong
OL,8,Fway down a dual carriageway crashed
OL,9,Finto their vehicle was "our hero" and
OL,10,F"willing to help anyone", his family
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FPC Tom Clough, 38, died alongside his
OL,14,Fcolleague PC Matthew Blades, 37, when a
OL,15,FVolkswagen Passat, which officers had
OL,16,Fbeen pursuing until seconds before,
OL,17,Fcollided with their marked armed
OL,18,Fresponse car on the A66 near
OL,19,FMiddlesbrough on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
